{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019ntssmKGchh8cbSqeN89ie","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t- index: 0\n2\t  title: srd002-sys -- pkg/sys (contract)\n3\t  description: |\n4\t    deliverable_type: code\n5\t\n6\t    required_reading:\n7\t      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd002-sys.yaml (full SRD for pkg/sys)\n8\t      - CLAUDE.md (SIGPIPE handling pattern and project conventions)\n9\t\n10\t    files:\n11\t      - path: pkg/sys/fileinfo.go\n12\t        action: create\n13\t        note: FileInfo struct and Stat/Lstat function stubs\n14\t      - path: pkg/sys/terminal.go\n15\t        action: create\n16\t        note: TerminalWidth and IsTerminal function stubs\n17\t      - path: pkg/sys/signal.go\n18\t        action: create\n19\t        note: InstallSIGPIPEHandler and OnTerminalResize function stubs\n20\t\n21\t    requirements:\n22\t      - id: R1\n23\t        text: \"Define FileInfo struct with fields: Mode os.FileMode, Size int64, Nlink uint64, Uid uint32, Gid uint32, Rdev uint64, Dev uint64, Ino uint64, Blocks int64, Blksize int64, ModTime time.Time, AccessTime time.Time, ChangeTime time.Time, Info os.FileInfo\"\n24\t      - id: R2\n25\t        text: \"Define file metadata function signatures as stubs: Stat(path string) (*FileInfo, error), Lstat(path string) (*FileInfo, error)\"\n26\t      - id: R3\n27\t        text: \"Define terminal function signatures as stubs: TerminalWidth() (int, error), IsTerminal(fd uintptr) bool\"\n28\t      - id: R4\n29\t        text: \"Define signal function signatures as stubs: InstallSIGPIPEHandler(), OnTerminalResize(callback func(width int))\"\n30\t\n31\t    design_decisions:\n32\t      - id: D1\n33\t        text: \"Split exports across three files by domain: fileinfo.go (struct and stat functions), terminal.go (terminal queries), signal.go (signal handlers)\"\n34\t      - id: D2\n35\t        text: \"Package must not import any cmd/ package or any other pkg/ package\"\n36\t      - id: D3